<title>BRAZIL: Brazil sets dollar buy tender in commercial market.</title>
<headline>Brazil sets dollar buy tender in commercial market.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Central Bank announced a dollar buy tender in commercial foreign exchange market, dealers said.</p>
<p>The real was quoted at 1.0535 per dollar before the auction, they added.</p>
<p>((-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 2485415))</p>
</text>
